      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Volume and linear measures of the heart (absolute as well as relative) are investigated in 640 patients (male + female). The heart size increases with increasing age. Radiological heart size shows in comparison with clinical diagnosis and findings no evidence for an old-age heart. The increasing heart size due to age is rather expression of multimorbidity during lifetime."},
